<body>
  <p class="center no-indent"><b>TRUONG / DON VI DAO TAO</b></p>
  <p class="center no-indent"><b>BO MON CONG NGHE THONG TIN</b></p>
  <br />
  <br />
  <p class="center no-indent"><b>BAO CAO NGHIEN CUU KHOA HOC</b></p>
  <h1>Phan tich, thiet ke va xay dung website thuong mai dien tu Snikei Shop</h1>
  <br />
  <p class="no-indent"><b>Linh vuc:</b> Cong nghe thong tin - Phat trien ung dung web</p>
  <p class="no-indent"><b>Don vi thuc hien:</b> Nhom phat trien du an Snikei Shop</p>
  <p class="no-indent"><b>Thoi gian:</b> 05/2026</p>
  <br />

  <h2>Tom tat de tai</h2>
  <p>
    De tai tap trung nghien cuu va xay dung he thong website ban giay truc tuyen theo mo hinh MVC bang PHP thuan, su dung MySQL lam he quan tri co so du lieu.
    San pham dat muc tieu xay dung day du chu trinh nghiep vu cua mot website thuong mai dien tu quy mo nho den trung binh, bao gom quan ly nguoi dung,
    quan ly san pham, gio hang, dat hang, theo doi giao dich va dashboard cho quan tri vien.
  </p>
  <p>
    Ket qua dat duoc la mot he thong co cau truc ro rang, de mo rong, co kha nang van hanh tren moi truong XAMPP pho bien.
    Nghien cuu cung chi ra cac diem manh ve tinh don gian trong trien khai va cac han che can tiep tuc cai tien ve bao mat, tu dong hoa kiem thu,
    va to chuc route theo huong framework.
  </p>

  <h2>Tu khoa</h2>
  <p class="no-indent">PHP MVC, thuong mai dien tu, gio hang, quan ly don hang, website ban giay, MySQL.</p>

  <div class="page-break"></div>

  <h2>1. Dat van de</h2>
  <p>
    Nhu cau mua sam truc tuyen trong linh vuc thoi trang, dac biet la giay dep, tang nhanh trong nhieu nam gan day.
    Doanh nghiep nho can mot giai phap website co chi phi hop ly, de trien khai, de quan tri va dap ung day du cac nghiep vu cot loi.
    Tu bai toan thuc tien do, de tai lua chon huong xay dung he thong Snikei Shop theo kien truc MVC voi cong nghe PHP thuong dung.
  </p>
  <p>
    Bai toan nghien cuu dat ra: lam the nao de xay dung mot he thong web co tinh mo dun, phan tach ro giao dien - xu ly - du lieu,
    dong thoi dam bao duoc trai nghiem nguoi dung va kha nang quan tri van hanh o muc co ban.
  </p>

  <h2>2. Muc tieu nghien cuu</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Xay dung website thuong mai dien tu cho phep duyet san pham, them vao gio hang, thanh toan va quan ly don hang.</li>
    <li>Ap dung mo hinh MVC trong to chuc ma nguon de tang tinh bao tri va kha nang mo rong.</li>
    <li>Thiet lap khu vuc quan tri ho tro theo doi doanh thu, giao dich, nguoi dung va san pham.</li>
    <li>Danh gia ket qua trien khai thong qua phan tich chuc nang, cau truc va cac chi tieu van hanh co ban.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>3. Doi tuong va pham vi nghien cuu</h2>
  <h3>3.1. Doi tuong nghien cuu</h3>
  <p>
    He thong website Snikei Shop trong thu muc du an, bao gom toan bo source code backend frontend, cau hinh co so du lieu,
    va cac chuc nang da duoc trien khai cho nguoi dung va quan tri vien.
  </p>
  <h3>3.2. Pham vi nghien cuu</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Tap trung vao phan tich kien truc phan mem va luong nghiep vu cot loi.</li>
    <li>Khong di sau vao toi uu ha tang cloud, kha nang scale ngang quy mo lon.</li>
    <li>Khong mo rong sang ung dung di dong native.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>4. Phuong phap nghien cuu</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Phuong phap phan tich he thong: phan ra actor, use case va luong du lieu.</li>
    <li>Phuong phap thiet ke huong mo dun: phan lop Controller - Model - View.</li>
    <li>Phuong phap thuc nghiem: cai dat tren XAMPP, test cac route chinh, doi chieu ket qua voi yeu cau nghiep vu.</li>
    <li>Phuong phap danh gia: dua tren tinh dung chuc nang, tinh de bao tri, va muc do dap ung vai tro nguoi dung/quan tri.</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="page-break"></div>

  <h2>5. Co so ly thuyet va cong nghe su dung</h2>
  <h3>5.1. Mo hinh MVC</h3>
  <p>
    MVC cho phep tach biet phan giao dien (View), xu ly nghiep vu (Controller) va truy xuat du lieu (Model).
    Trong Snikei Shop, front controller nam tai public/index.php tiep nhan request, dinh tuyen route va dieu phoi den controller tuong ung.
  </p>

  <h3>5.2. Cong nghe su dung</h3>
  <table>
    <tr>
      <th>Thanh phan</th>
      <th>Cong nghe</th>
      <th>Vai tro</th>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Backend</td>
      <td>PHP 8+</td>
      <td>Xu ly nghiep vu, route, session, phan quyen</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>CSDL</td>
      <td>MySQL / MariaDB</td>
      <td>Luu tru users, products, cart, orders, reviews...</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Ket noi DB</td>
      <td>PDO</td>
      <td>Thuc thi truy van, prepared statements</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Frontend</td>
      <td>HTML, CSS, JavaScript</td>
      <td>Hien thi giao dien va tuong tac nguoi dung</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Quan ly phu thuoc</td>
      <td>Composer (PSR-4)</td>
      <td>Autoload class va to chuc namespace</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Moi truong trien khai</td>
      <td>XAMPP</td>
      <td>Chay Apache + MySQL local</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <h2>6. Phan tich thiet ke he thong</h2>
  <h3>6.1. Kien truc tong quan</h3>
  <p>
    He thong duoc to chuc theo cau truc thu muc app/controllers, app/models, app/views, ket hop front controller tai public/index.php.
    Cach to chuc nay giup lap trinh vien tach ro trach nhiem tung lop, han che viec tron lan logic nghiep vu vao giao dien.
  </p>

  <h3>6.2. Phan he chuc nang</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Phan he khach hang: trang chu, danh muc, shop, chi tiet san pham, gio hang, checkout, profile, lien he, blog.</li>
    <li>Phan he xac thuc: dang ky, dang nhap, dang xuat, quan ly session va vai tro.</li>
    <li>Phan he quan tri: dashboard, quan ly san pham, khach hang, tin nhan, thanh toan, thue, lich su giao dich.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>6.3. Luong nghiep vu dat hang</h3>
  <p>
    Nguoi dung dang nhap va them san pham vao gio hang thong qua route process_addcart.
    He thong tao cart neu chua ton tai, sau do them cart_item theo cart_id.
    Khi checkout, he thong kiem tra du lieu hop le, tao thong tin payment_qr trong session,
    chuyen sang man hinh QR, va khi xac nhan da thanh toan se tao ban ghi orders va order_items,
    dong thoi cap nhat ton kho san pham, xoa du lieu gio hang.
  </p>

  <h3>6.4. Mo hinh du lieu chinh</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>users: thong tin tai khoan va vai tro (user/admin).</li>
    <li>products: thong tin san pham, gia, so luong, hinh anh, danh muc.</li>
    <li>cart, cart_items: luu tam san pham nguoi dung da chon.</li>
    <li>orders, order_items: luu giao dich sau khi thanh toan.</li>
    <li>reviews: danh gia san pham boi nguoi dung.</li>
    <li>addresses: thong tin dia chi va avatar ho so nguoi dung.</li>
    <li>contact: luu tin nhan lien he tu website.</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="page-break"></div>

  <h2>7. Trien khai va ket qua</h2>
  <h3>7.1. Ket qua chuc nang dat duoc</h3>
  <table>
    <tr>
      <th>Nhom chuc nang</th>
      <th>Mo ta ket qua</th>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Quan ly tai khoan</td>
      <td>Dang ky tai khoan moi, dang nhap bang mat khau ma hoa hash, dang xuat va luu session.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Quan ly san pham</td>
      <td>Hien thi danh sach, xem chi tiet, loc theo danh muc, quan tri them/sua/xoa.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Gio hang va thanh toan</td>
      <td>Them vao gio, tao don hang, luu order items, cap nhat ton kho, don trang thai thanh toan.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Quan tri he thong</td>
      <td>Dashboard thong ke users/products/orders/messages, theo doi doanh thu theo thang.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Ho tro nghiep vu khac</td>
      <td>Quan ly lien he, lich su giao dich, invoice, taxes, calendar su kien.</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <h3>7.2. Danh gia ket qua theo muc tieu</h3>
  <p>
    Doi chieu voi muc tieu de tai, he thong da dat duoc bo khung thuong mai dien tu day du cho quy mo do an.
    Kien truc MVC duoc ap dung nhat quan trong to chuc source code; cac model su dung PDO va prepared statements,
    giup han che SQL injection. Khu vuc admin co phan quyen theo session role, dap ung yeu cau quan tri co ban.
  </p>

  <h2>8. Thao luan khoa hoc</h2>
  <h3>8.1. Uu diem</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Cau truc thu muc ro rang, de hoc va de bao tri.</li>
    <li>Luong nghiep vu mua hang duoc lien ket tu duyet san pham den tao don va cap nhat ton kho.</li>
    <li>Co day du module quan tri va thong ke de theo doi tinh hinh kinh doanh.</li>
    <li>Tinh tuong thich cao voi moi truong local pho bien (XAMPP).</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>8.2. Han che</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Route duoc khai bao thu cong trong switch-case, kho mo rong khi he thong tang quy mo.</li>
    <li>Thong tin ket noi DB hien dang hard-code, chua tach bien moi truong.</li>
    <li>Thanh toan QR mo phong qua session, chua tich hop cong thanh toan thuc te co callback xac thuc.</li>
    <li>Chua co bo test tu dong unit test/integration test hoan chinh.</li>
    <li>Muc bao mat upload file anh can bo sung kiem tra mime type va doi ten file an toan.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>8.3. De xuat huong phat trien</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Chuan hoa router thanh mot module dinh tuyen rieng, ho tro middleware.</li>
    <li>Tach cau hinh vao file .env, bo sung quan ly secret.</li>
    <li>Bo sung test tu dong, pipeline CI, va logging loi tap trung.</li>
    <li>Tich hop thanh toan that (VNPay/MoMo/Stripe) kem webhook doi soat giao dich.</li>
    <li>Toi uu truy van va bo nho dem cho cac trang co tai cao.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>9. Ket luan</h2>
  <p>
    De tai da xay dung thanh cong website Snikei Shop theo dinh huong nghien cuu ung dung,
    dap ung cac yeu cau cot loi cua mot he thong thuong mai dien tu: quan ly tai khoan,
    danh muc san pham, gio hang, dat hang, thanh toan, va quan tri du lieu kinh doanh.
    Ket qua cho thay mo hinh MVC bang PHP van hieu qua trong bai toan dao tao va du an vua-nho,
    dong thoi mo ra kha nang nang cap theo huong chuyen nghiep hon trong giai doan tiep theo.
  </p>

  <h2>10. Tai lieu tham khao</h2>
  <p class="no-indent">[1] Tai lieu PHP chinh thuc: https://www.php.net/docs.php</p>
  <p class="no-indent">[2] Tai lieu PDO va prepared statements: https://www.php.net/manual/en/book.pdo.php</p>
  <p class="no-indent">[3] Tai lieu MySQL: https://dev.mysql.com/doc/</p>
  <p class="no-indent">[4] Ma nguon du an Snikei Shop trong workspace hien tai.</p>

  <br />
  <p class="center no-indent"><b>--- HET ---</b></p>
